{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02949","headline":"安乐公主移入新宅侍宴应制 · 宗楚客","name":"安乐公主移入新宅侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星桥他日创，仙牓此时开。\n马向铺钱埒，箫闻弄玉台。\n人同卫叔美，客似长卿才。\n借问游天汉，谁能取石回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗楚客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}